      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Careful with that combination, as MAOIs require you to avoid tyramine-rich foods. Aged cheeses and cured meats are high in tyramine, which can cause a dangerous hypertensive crisis when combined with MAOIs. Instead, focus on lean poultry, fish, beans, and tofu for your protein needs. You can use low-sodium soy sauce or fresh herbs for flavoring to keep your diet safe and protein-rich.",
      "source": "target",
